                  <photoshop:LayerText>COMBINE WORLD PRESENTS: COMPLETE STAINLESS UNDERSIDES FOR JD &amp; FLEXI-COIL   METER HOUSINGS WITH AND WITHOUT SECTIONAL CONTROL   HALF-WIDTH DISCONNECTS FOR JD METER BOX  COUPLERS    SEED/DELIVERY TUBES    CONVEYOR HOUSINGS &amp; PARTS    DISTRIBUTOR HEADS/MANIFOLDS FOR ANY AIR DRILL WITH 2.5"  INPUTS AND 1" OR 1.5" OUTPUTS  ON THE SECONDARY MANIFOLDS/TOWERS. MAY FIT BOURGAULT, SEED HAWK, SEEDMASTER, JD &amp; FLEXI-COIL/CNH DRILLS, AMONG OTHERS   SECONDARY TOWERS FOR JD AIR DRILLS   TUBE RISER WELDMENTS FOR FLEXI-COIL/CNH AIR DRILLS   FLAT DISTRIBUTORS FOR MORRIS AIR &amp; DISC DRILLS   MANIFOLDS &amp; MANIFOLD BRACKETS    TUBE WELDMENTS FOR FLEXI-COIL/CNH AIR CARTS    AIR PLENUMS, PLATES, SHUT-OFF PLATES   SHIMS AND BRACKETS ANYTHING ELSE YOU MAY NEED, GIVE US A CALL.</photoshop:LayerText>
